{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":223242,"duration_api_ms":292994,"num_turns":20,"result":"The habitat registry system is **already fully implemented and passing all tests**. Here's what exists:\n\n- `types/habitat.rs`: `HabitatKind` enum (5 habitats), `HabitatEntry` struct, `compute_habitat_registry()`, `find_habitat()`\n- `types/state.rs`: `habitat_registry: Vec<HabitatEntry>` field on `TankState`\n- `engine.rs`: daily recomputation in the day-boundary pipeline\n- `save.rs`: schema v5→v6 migration adding habitat fields, post-migration fixup\n- `types/mod.rs` + `lib.rs`: public re-exports\n- `tests/habitat_registry.rs`: 24 tests all passing\n- Clippy clean, all 200+ tests pass\n\n```json\n{\n  \"change_summary\": \"The habitat registry and colonizable-area model is already fully implemented. No code changes were needed.\\n\\nExisting implementation includes:\\n- HabitatKind enum with all 5 target habitats (FilterMedia, GlassHardscape, PlantSurfaces, SubstrateSurface, SubstrateDeep) in types/habitat.rs\\n- HabitatEntry struct with colonizable_area_cm2 and three bounded [0,1] exposure modifiers (flow, oxygen, light), all documented and serializable\\n- compute_habitat_registry() derives areas from geometry (wall_area_cm2, footprint_area_cm2, hardscape_area_cm2), hardware (filter.media_area_cm2), plant state (biomass_g × guild-specific SLA), and substrate layers (colonizable_area_cm2)\\n- Exposure modifiers are responsive to filter flow/clogging, aeration intensity, light intensity, plant crowding, substrate low-oxygen tendency, rooted plant root-zone O2 boost, and depth attenuation\\n- Registry stored as Vec<HabitatEntry> on TankState with #[serde(default)], recomputed daily in engine day-boundary pipeline\\n- Schema v5→v6 migration adds habitat_registry, geometry.hardscape_area_cm2, and filter.media_area_cm2 with post-migration fixup\\n- Public API exports: HabitatKind, HabitatEntry, compute_habitat_registry(), find_habitat()\\n- 24 comprehensive tests covering serialization round-trips, area computation, modifier sensitivity, bounds validation, plant biomass responsiveness, registry invariants, and geometry scaling\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Explore codebase to understand existing types, state, geometry, substrate, hardware, plant models, engine orchestration, save/migration, and test coverage\",\n      \"order\": 0,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verify types/habitat.rs contains HabitatKind enum with all 5 target habitats (FilterMedia, GlassHardscape, PlantSurfaces, SubstrateSurface, SubstrateDeep) and HabitatEntry struct with colonizable_area_cm2 and bounded [0,1] exposure modifiers\",\n      \"order\": 1,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verify compute_habitat_registry() derives colonizable areas from geometry, hardware config, plant biomass (via guild-specific SLA constants), and substrate layer properties rather than hardcoded constants\",\n      \"order\": 2,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verify flow, oxygen, and light exposure modifiers are documented, bounded via .clamp(0.0, 1.0), and responsive to relevant scenario inputs (filter flow/clogging, aeration intensity, light intensity, plant crowding, substrate low-oxygen tendency, rooted plant root-zone boost, depth attenuation)\",\n      \"order\": 3,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verify habitat_registry: Vec<HabitatEntry> is serialized on TankState with #[serde(default)] and recomputed daily in engine.rs day-boundary pipeline via compute_habitat_registry()\",\n      \"order\": 4,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verify save.rs schema v5→v6 migration handles habitat_registry, geometry.hardscape_area_cm2, and filter.media_area_cm2 addition with post-migration fixup for pre-existing saves\",\n      \"order\": 5,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verify public API exports (HabitatKind, HabitatEntry, compute_habitat_registry, find_habitat) via types/mod.rs and lib.rs pub use types::*\",\n      \"order\": 6,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Run 24 habitat_registry tests: all pass covering serialization round-trips, area computation correctness, modifier sensitivity, bounds validation under extreme inputs, plant biomass responsiveness, registry invariants, and geometry scaling\",\n      \"order\": 7,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Run full test suite (200+ tests) and clippy: all pass with zero warnings, confirming habitat registry integrates cleanly with existing systems\",\n      \"order\": 8,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": [\n    \"24/24 habitat_registry tests pass: habitat_kind_serialization_round_trip, habitat_entry_serialization_round_trip, full_registry_serialization_round_trip, filter_media_area_matches_hardware_config, filter_media_area_zero_when_disabled, glass_hardscape_area_equals_wall_plus_hardscape, plant_surfaces_area_from_biomass_and_sla, plant_surfaces_zero_without_plants, substrate_surface_area_equals_footprint, substrate_surface_zero_without_substrate, substrate_deep_area_sums_layer_colonizable_areas, higher_flow_increases_flow_exposure, aeration_boosts_oxygen_exposure, clogging_reduces_filter_oxygen, light_intensity_affects_exposure, rooted_plants_boost_substrate_surface_oxygen, plant_crowding_reduces_light_exposure, substrate_deep_always_dark, substrate_deep_oxygen_capped, all_modifiers_bounded_under_extreme_inputs, plant_biomass_change_updates_area, registry_covers_all_habitat_kinds, find_habitat_returns_none_for_missing, larger_tank_produces_larger_wall_and_substrate_areas\",\n    \"Full workspace test suite passes: 200+ tests across tank_core, tank_scenarios, tank_harness, tank_data, tank_tui, tank_api with 0 failures\",\n    \"cargo clippy clean: zero warnings across all crates in the workspace\",\n    \"Serialization verified: HabitatKind, HabitatEntry, and full Vec<HabitatEntry> registry all round-trip correctly through serde_json\",\n    \"Area computation verified: FilterMedia matches hardware.filter.media_area_cm2, GlassHardscape equals wall_area_cm2 + hardscape_area_cm2, PlantSurfaces equals sum(biomass_g * SLA) with FastStem=40 and RootRosette=25 cm²/g, SubstrateSurface equals footprint_area_cm2, SubstrateDeep sums layer.colonizable_area_cm2\",\n    \"Modifier bounds verified: all_modifiers_bounded_under_extreme_inputs test exercises 4 extreme scenarios (max_everything, min_everything, max_clogging_with_filter, huge_tank) and confirms all modifiers in [0,1] and areas >= 0\",\n    \"Plant biomass responsiveness verified: plant_biomass_change_updates_area test confirms PlantSurfaces area tracks biomass changes (5g→200cm², 20g→800cm² for FastStem)\",\n    \"Modifier sensitivity verified: tests confirm higher flow increases flow_exposure, aeration boosts oxygen_exposure, clogging reduces FilterMedia oxygen, light intensity increases light_exposure, rooted plants boost SubstrateSurface oxygen, crowding reduces GlassHardscape light, SubstrateDeep always dark (0.0 light) and oxygen-capped (<=0.2)\"\n  ],\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    \"TankSnapshot (API serialization view) does not currently include habitat_registry data — downstream consumers that read snapshots rather than full TankState won't see habitat information until the snapshot type is extended\",\n    \"Periphyton capacity in algae_growth.rs uses a single colonizable area value rather than reading from the habitat registry — this will need wiring when tanksim-6e5.5.3 splits periphyton pools by habitat\",\n    \"Nitrification in nitrogen_cycle.rs is still global (not habitat-indexed) — the registry provides the modifiers but downstream systems (tanksim-6e5.5.2) must opt in to use 